# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/daycycle.js, the sun coming up.
title    Dawn
composer Claude
about    Day breaks: a crystal run rising over F and then C, wind chimes, and the bird's wide call.
tempo    90
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.55

# mood explore: bird sweep harm chimes

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.75
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.26 pan=-0.3 rev=0.65
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.22 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.4 rel=1.2
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.36 pan=-0.35

pattern rise
sweep   | F4- A4- C5- E5- G5- A5- | C5 E5 G5 C6 .------- |
harm    | [F]?----------- | [C]?----------- |
chimes  | ...... x..... | x..x.. ...... |
bird    | _ | .----- G6 C6+D6---- |

loop rise
